        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gisilleanda roat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha gaweesa fuga ang'oonyi gwaadi ea fuga riing'eega gooleeysiit niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoaniikghi Farisaayajeega ea ng'oorshoodiga nea gwayi, “Siisi gaguursa fuga riing'eega ak goombuutooschi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa galeega nea gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nih gajea anasihi aba jeedeang'wa mideawa gisil bughala, ama roat agi ea maygwanung'usa heeda giika was seedam ea damashageashiin, ak gawa dareabeeta gagasa diita roadiin ea ghwanyas? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu nea ghwanyas, ghwayiin gheataanyi nea gahoosan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu nea ghwahita gheanyi gaguursa fuga duupchi ea fuga ascheayi ak gwayeesha, ‘Ahoosana sea aniini aba gideaba naanyaschi gisilleandeanyu roat.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu, ak geayeeshiineegwa, gaygwanda hooseaneega muuchi aba humng'eeda aba badayda siyagi mideawa riing'eeda ak gwaduukuuna, maygawuurji fugiga was seedam ea damashageash doobiiweadi magassa duukuunoodean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiliingajeanda roat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nih gajea ana gatmu, mideawa shiliingaji damanamughuush, ama roat akaleala ea maygoorabeat gheaboonyaneeda, ak goobuus gheeda ak gagasiischi muuchi ea ghwanyasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu nea ghwanyas gaguursa fuga duupchi ea giischeewdaanyi ak gwayeesha, ‘Eehoosana eesa sean aba gideaba naanyaschi shiliingajeandida gwachi roadiin.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu, ak geayeeshiineegwa, gaygahoosan malaykajeega ASEETA aba badayda siida asagi mideawa riing'eeda iiduukuuna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orjeeda roat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ghayi gwanda siisi mideawa orju iyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwayeesha daamwanang' ghwaan, ‘Bwaabwa, gwalnean haleanjeeda miisean.’ Ng'ata gagwalsa duwaawi haleanjeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama miighang'ata eawoojisu saang'a ghang'eat orjeeda mwanang' ghwashaayda haleanjeadaanyi sean ak gawa bareanyeeka ea gawa ng'eanyiida sheagi, hita ghwasaksakta haleanjeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyi bwak ama niduulu haleanjeadaanyi sean ghang'eat geejeeda haw aba ng'eanyiita, ak eara niny gaba fuga gasa gichea ghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gawa gadiyeeda aba hichpa siyagi bea ng'eanyiita, ak ghwanung' siidida gawa madamnyeandaanyi ghoarear ukurmajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Gagasa ghwaak hamita ak ukurmajeega ak ea manda siisi adaw gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeeng'u aba Jeadaanyi gwayi, ‘Gwadeanaan soomjooga agiischi aba ghaheanya, ea ghwalach hamichoojiga nea aniini gayghabwaran jalooda aba hiji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydang'eat dawa heeda ghweandeanyu ak geayeeshi niny, “Bwaabwa neadiiysi humng'eeda ea madeadaang'u; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mamiisean gideaba gajeeguureewean baleandaang'u, nung' dawuurji fiisu was soomjoogeaba gheang'uun.”’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ak gabiikta heeda ghwaan. Hean nea gudu ea dildeaweat ghoang'wearda ghwaan ama dea ghabwayda ak ghafwach ghwadeapta nea ghwasam gheata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Orjeedida niny, ‘Bwaabwa aniini neadiiysi humng'eeda ea madeadaang'u, mamiisean gideaba gajeeguureewean orjeedang'u.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ghwaan ak gwayeesha soomjoagaaschi, ‘Alamwaja ayeani hang'dida miyiin ak gookwealsi, nea gooshuupchi mooneeda ghuniida nea gooleapsi eara geeka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooyeadu meaydida riishaadiin ak goonuuschi, eayaaga nea geehoosanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba orjeeni iteanyuun ghayi nimi, ak ghamneawa ea niduudu; ghayi niroat ak ghamneawa ea sinyas.’ Ak geebiisa eang'eat hooseaneega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda orjeedaanyi haw gwanda madamnyeanda, damani duu gwandeawa naweeda nea niriiksa gheedean ghwayiiy ghuuta sarmeeda ea deangheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa soomjeanda ak ghoanyaashta nea gwayeesha, Gwandaani hiji? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha niny, ‘Nibiigu orjeeda geamadu ak ea ninuus gweanu meayda riishaat aba gideaba nibiigu nea gudeamajeek.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyareas orjeedida hawiin, ak ghaheawa gawa ghoah. Iidu gwarita ghwaan jarooda ak gamearmearani niny ghwaan ghoah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwasha nea gwayeesha ghwaan, ‘Daaha, aniini naaweacheey gweanyeeka saang'a, nea moang'wa danung'waada huumeandaang'u; nea miigoonean eara dayeenda ak geahoosanyi sea fuga eaduupcheewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.29"
            ]
          }
