              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, ‘Orjeedeanyu, ang'iing'i geendeaydooschi galeagasean ak haleanjeeda eandeawi sean ea gaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.31",
