              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gicha iisihoosan ghwahit geeng'weela aba gideaba orjeeni bea geamaduun ghayi nimi, ak ghamneawa ea niduudu, ghayi niroat, ak ea sinyas.’”",
          "type": "text",
